  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> strong metacreativity <strong>ML</strong> 18th; <strong>Cost</strong> 122,400 GP<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> head <strong>Weight</strong> —<br>\nThis psicrown has 100 power points. This bronze circlet is unornamented except for the heads of a cobra and a falcon centered over the brow. Each one has eyes of deep crystal. It allows use of the following powers:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>astral seed</li>\n<li>genesis</li>\n<li>quintessence</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Recharge</strong><br>\n<strong>Cost</strong> 18 pp, <strong>Gain</strong> 18 pp<br>\n<strong>Construction</strong><br>\n61,200gp; Craft Staff, astral seed, genesis, quintessence</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-magic-items#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
